<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,258.25 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,258.25 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished at a fifth successive closing high of 6,258.25 points, up 1.20, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 2.547 billion forints, down from 3.459 billion on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
